id: pm-rust-zmqa
title: Enable the gated pm-github issue sync
description: "Add the pinned reusable issue-sync caller and verify the existing CI workflow_dispatch trigger. Related adoption task: pm-github-aiok. Rust-only package: no root package.json and no braces dependency work. Validate just release-check and the locked-oracle strict health check; never trigger sync or change repository settings."
type: Chore
status: blocked
priority: 2
tags[1]: changed
created_at: "2026-10-15T07:37:36.274Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-16T10:37:45.145Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-15T07:38:15.834Z",codex-agent,Batch 3 uses the prescribed 2026.10.14 fallback because v2026.10.15 is not released. CI already has workflow_dispatch. The exact fallback workflow still assumes root npm dependencies and predates changelog regeneration and CI dispatch from pm-github PR 122; this Rust-only caller needs the later repin before operational use. No root package.json is added. No runtime code changed and no behavioural revert is applicable. Install and use the committed tests/oracle lockfile exactly as CI does.
  "2026-10-15T08:33:12.035Z",codex-agent,"Full isolated just release-check PASS: 318/318 regular tests and 318/318 instrumented tests across 17 suites each, zero failures and ignored cases. Coverage: lines 5647/5647, functions 522/522, regions 8631/8631, branches 1194/1194 (all 100% at unchanged floors). fmt, clippy -D warnings, private-item rustdoc, native identity audit, required published-oracle differentials and canonical changelog check passed. cargo audit exited 0 with its pre-existing allowed unmaintained unsafe-libyaml 0.2.11 warning RUSTSEC-2024-0449; no vulnerability findings were reported. Locked oracle 2026.10.14 was installed exactly as CI does. Isolated oracle health --check-only --require-merge-drivers --strict-exit passes with existing guidance, staleness and provenance advisories. No histories were rewritten."
  "2026-10-15T13:03:43.939Z",claude-hub,"Final repin recorded: .github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml now pins unbraind/pm-github@3015930b351a3d9c1c03ee4a26f8404025287df7 (pm-github 2026.10.15) and passes pm-github-version 2026.10.15 with actions: write (commit 07b7891 on this branch). The earlier comment that said a later repin was still needed describes the 2026.10.14 interim state and is historical. The locked oracle stays 2026.10.14; it records the validation oracle, not the caller pin."
  "2026-10-15T15:34:31.850Z",claude-hub,"BLOCKED (review of PR 84, CodeRabbit on 357f548): the pinned reusable workflow runs npm ci at the caller root and this repository has no root package.json (oracle in tests/oracle), so the sync would stop at Install dependencies. Upstream fix tracked in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-github/issues/129 (npm-project-dir input). PR 84 is a draft until that pm-github release; then pass npm-project-dir: tests/oracle and repin."
  "2026-10-16T10:37:45.145Z",claude-orchestrator,"2026-10-16: pm-github 2026.10.16 (tag 67a5e3e) accepts npm-project-dir (pm-github#130, closes pm-github#129) and resolves the caller default branch through the API (#131). The sync caller now pins 2026.10.16 with npm-project-dir tests/oracle, post-import-script disabled (the oracle project has no npm scripts; just owns the changelog) and ci-workflows ci.yml. Added the daily gated closeout caller with the same pin and project directory."
files[2]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/ci.yml,project,Existing workflow_dispatch confirmed without modification
  .github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml,project,Pinned gated sync caller
